  <goal>
    The binding spec is `projects/unified-access-control-r2/notes/handoffs/INCOMING-145-secure-setup-handler.md` (on master since
    #1312): §2 handler (inputs, steps S0–S9 each read-then-write, §5.4 strip after every grant, idempotency key over a hash of
