    (binding, one control-plane gap). Without it every new environment refuses secure records. Also from the UAC-r2 audit:
    an environment WITHOUT the `sprk_noaccessentry` table denies every read — it must exist before the BFF deploy (solution
    component, T218, or this handler).
  </goal>

